  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_6c37bd64-0872-4933-8701-9be71baa604a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"834\" height=\"469\"></span></strong></p>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">廢棄瞭望塔</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">是由</span> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MasterOWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">MasterOWS</span></a> <span style=\"color:#fff\">製作的瞭望塔模組</span></strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<h2>支援<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Forge</span> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">1.20.1</span></strong> 與<strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">1.19.2</span></strong>，以及<strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">NeoForge</span> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">1.21.1</span></strong> 與<strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">1.21.4</span></strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fabandoned-watchtowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_59025fc5-22ce-4614-a6ad-1a92522454e7.png\" alt=\"Modrinth Icon\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></span></strong></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-watchtowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_dc1e4831-2a8f-48a1-962c-65b66ad50890.png\" alt=\"CurseForge link\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></span></strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MasterOWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_4685c306-a947-4da3-8f06-4455c31ebb04.png\" alt=\"Youtube icon link\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></span></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>廢棄瞭望塔是一款會生成於森林生態域的瞭望塔模組。具體包含：森林、繁花森林、針葉林、白樺林與平原。非常適合恐怖或冒險整合包，也是新手第一晚的理想庇護所。</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>📝功能特色：</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>隨機房間生成</li>\n<li>隨機多樣樓梯</li>\n<li>隨機戰利品生成</li>\n<li>2 種不同版本，其中一種極為罕見</li>\n<li>夜間遠處可見的照明燈光</li>\n<li>不同高度的塔樓</li>\n<li>陽台椅子</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>🙋常見問題：</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Q:</span> 瞭望塔內有多張床嗎？</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">A:</span> </strong>有！部分房間生成配置最多可容納 4 張床，供你的朋友使用！<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Q:</span> 與其他模組相容嗎？</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">A:</span> </strong>是的！您可以將「廢棄瞭望塔」與任何其他模組搭配使用！<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Q:</span> 如何調整生成機率/生成半徑？</strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">A: </span></strong>請使用<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-watchtowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka API for abandoned watchtowers</a></strong>來進行設定，您可在<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-watchtowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></strong>找到它。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">⚖️使用規範：</span><br></strong></h2>\n<p><strong>歡迎在任意整合包或影片中使用了「廢棄瞭望塔」，雖非強制，但強烈建議附上作者署名。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>僅有<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">CurseForge</span> 與 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Modrinth</span> 為官方發布平台，其他網站下載的檔案可能夾帶惡意軟體或病毒。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>未經授權，請勿將我的作品上傳至其他平台。<br></strong></p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">🔌版本資訊：</span></strong></h2>\n<p><strong>如果您想要更豐富的模組化體驗，可以來看看<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-watchtowers-refurnished\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">廢棄瞭望塔：</span>&nbsp;</a><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-watchtowers-refurnished\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">重新裝潢版 (Refurnished)</a>!</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1274025/description_622624f1-355a-4b08-811c-550eafe961d2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">如果您喜歡我的 Minecraft 模組，歡迎前往我的</span> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">YouTube</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">頻道觀看更多內容：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MasterOWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡！</a></span></span></strong></p>",
